<title>USA: St. Peter, Minn., $2.275 mln won by Cronin &amp; Co.</title>
<headline>St. Peter, Minn., $2.275 mln won by Cronin &amp; Co.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
